        <activityName xml:lang="en">Polyurethane, rigid foam, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Polyurethane, rigid foam, at plant
Dataset represents just one possible composition for a rigid PUR foam.;
CAS number: 009009-54-5; 
Synonyms: PUR; 
UUID: a7c19342-01d0-37f6-86bf-7ecf91a7d206
This dataset contains the transports of the monomers as well as the production (energy, air emissions) of the PUR foam
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Present technology used in Europe. Transport and infrastructure - average values added.
Time period: date of publication
Production volume: 5 Mt (Total PUR consumption 1990)
Sampling: data from industry report 
Extrapolations: see technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a7c19342-01d0-37f6-86bf-7ecf91a7d206.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
